@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Identity responsibilities and scoped contracts
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

component "LC-01 Identity / Access\nlogical module, not selected external IdP" as I
interface "Establish / end session\nprovided" as A
interface "Evaluate current authority / scoped grant change\nprovided" as P
interface "Account / credential / session store\nrequired" as D
interface "Current owner resource policy\nrequired" as R
I -right- A
I -down- P
I -left-( D
I -up-( R
note bottom of I
 User-directory, verification and session roles are internal responsibilities.
 No independent identity provider, JWT issuer or token microservice selected.
end note

@enduml
